    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s02-t03-drill-01-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第1题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s02-t03-drill-01",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26福建事考）浓度分别是15%、20%、25%的氢氧化钠溶液，按8：5：2的质量比进行混合，那么混合后溶液的浓度是（）。",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "18%"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "18.5%"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "19%"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "19.5%"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "A",
        "sourceAnswer": "A"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          25
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          19
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s02-t03-drill-01-p025.webp",
            "alt": "和差倍比问题（二） · 实战精刷1 · 讲义第19页",
            "pdfPage": 25
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s02-t03-drill-01-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s02-t03-drill-01",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：A"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先设三种溶液质量为8、5、2份，直接做加权平均。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "c=\\frac{8\\times15\\%+5\\times20\\%+2\\times25\\%}{8+5+2}=18\\%"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "所以选A。15%、20%、25%的算术平均20%不对，因为低浓度那组最多，整体应低于20%。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "三组混合用分子相加除以分母相加，不必强行套两组十字。"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
